sequenceDiagram
  participant N as /noodle page
  participant G as POST /api/noodle-polls/new
  participant P as vote page
  participant E as POST vote
  participant D as store
  N->>N: K = 32 random bytes
  N->>N: claim key = Ed25519 from HKDF(K, "noodle e2e claim v1")
  N->>G: claim public key (20 per IP per h)
  G-->>N: slug and token = claim.mac, nothing stored
  N->>P: open /noodle/slug?t=token plus fragment k=K (never sent)
  P->>P: empty draft page, K imports as the AES key
  P->>E: first commit: sealed vote, draft token, claim signature
  E->>E: token must be this slug's own
  E->>D: try_create e2e poll holding the claim, stats.record
  E->>E: claim signature over e2e-claim + voter pub verifies, claim spent
  E->>D: voter stored at order 0, so the host
  E-->>P: ok, page drops ?t= from the address
